---
layout: base.njk
title: Lesson Notes
description: "Weekly lesson notes by Mohammed Hanafi for Kindergarten, Lower Primary, Upper Primary and JHS, organised by term, class, subject and week."
active: notes
notesPage: true
pageHeader: true
heading: "Lesson Notes"
permalink: "/lesson-notes/"
breadcrumbs:
  - label: "Home"
    href: "/"
  - label: "Lesson Notes"
---
            <!-- Lesson notes Start -->
            <div class="container bg-white pt-5 pb-3">
{% if (collections.notes | length) > 0 %}
                <div class="row px-3 pb-3">
                    <div class="col-12">
                        <p class="mb-4">Weekly lesson notes you can download. Choose a term, then your class, to see the notes subject by subject and week by week.</p>
                        <nav class="notes-subjects" aria-label="Terms">
{%- for t in collections.noteTerms %}
                            <a href="#{{ t.termSlug }}" class="notes-chip">{{ t.term }}</a>
{%- endfor %}
                        </nav>
                    </div>
                </div>
{% for t in collections.noteTerms %}
                <section id="{{ t.termSlug }}" class="note-term px-3">
                    <h2 class="h4 font-weight-bold mb-3">{{ t.term }}</h2>
{%- for level in t.levels %}
                    <p class="note-level-title">{{ level.name }}{% if level.range %} <span>({{ level.range }})</span>{% endif %}</p>
                    <div class="notes-subjects mb-3">
{%- for c in level.classes %}
                        <a class="notes-chip" href="{{ c.url }}">{{ c.className }} <span class="note-count">{{ c.count }}<span class="sr-only"> notes</span></span></a>
{%- endfor %}
                    </div>
{%- else %}
                    <p class="text-muted">Notes for this term are coming soon.</p>
{%- endfor %}
                </section>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
                <div class="row px-3 pb-5">
                    <div class="col-12">
                        <p class="text-muted m-0">Lesson notes will appear here soon. Check back shortly.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
{% endif %}
            </div>
            <!-- Lesson notes End -->
